{"version":1,"content":"<p>漁護署推出「漁農自然綠悠遊」網站【詳情】，網站分5大主題，包括：玩樂情報、漁農自然主題體驗、精彩好去處搜尋、優鮮港品和山海禮儀，其中於「精彩好去處搜尋」界面，公眾可尋找例如農作物自摘、捕魚/農耕體驗、生態探索、遠足等資訊。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T04:04:34.584759+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T03:40:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T04:58:15.093435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T03:58:14.216731+00:00","content_hash":"bdd76684b53169fe2b187f653e19d2caa3638a456b4bc7cc2506c1cf216ffe1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}